# Whiley: Whiley Language Specification (whiley.org); requirements/languages/whiley.md
name     whiley
keyword  function method type import public private requires ensures where if else while for in return
keyword  switch case default break continue skip assert assume debug do is new old all some no
type     int bool byte void null
builtin  true false
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
